    "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds **ADR-042: Position (relative / absolute)** — closes ADR-033's deferral for `relative` + `absolute`, and delivers ADR-041's deferred visible delta: the **title \"HTML\" underline** via `.vector-page-titlebar::after`.\n\n**Documentation only.** Implementation (3 commits, ~600 lines) lands in a follow-up PR.\n\n## Why this closes three ADRs at once\n\n| ADR | What it left open | How ADR-042 closes it |\n|---|---|---|\n| **ADR-040** | h1 prediction (border shorthand would underline h1) | Root cause was already corrected in ADR-041: higher-specificity `.vector-page-titlebar .firstHeading { border: 0 }` wins; visible underline is `::after`, not h1 border |\n| **ADR-041** | Pseudo synthesis deferred (visible-delta Commit 2 skipped) | Pseudo synthesis + absolute positioning together in ADR-042's Commit 2 → title underline appears |\n| **ADR-033** | `relative` + `absolute` stored but treated as static | Both implemented; only `sticky` remains deferred |\n\n## Measurement\n\n| Position value | Wikipedia uses | In ADR-042 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `position: absolute` | **19** | ✅ Implemented |\n| `position: relative` | **22** | ✅ Implemented (containing block marker) |\n| `position: fixed` | 3 | ✅ Already handled (ADR-033) |\n| `position: sticky` | 2 | ⏳ Deferred (needs scroll state) |\n\n**First-viewport absolutes: 2 total.**\n- `.vector-page-titlebar::after` → **the visible target** (title underline)\n- `.vector-toc-toggle` → `display: none`, no visual\n\n**Containing blocks (relative) in first-viewport: 4** — `.vector-page-titlebar` (also flex per ADR-029), `.mw-page-container`, `.vector-body`, `.vector-search-box`.\n\n## Implementation plan\n\n**Commit 1 (behavior change, no first-viewport delta):**\n- `is_containing_block` field on `LayoutBox`\n- `top`/`bottom`/`left`/`right` parsing\n- Block/flex/grid dispatch skip absolute children, position after\n- Update ADR-033's stale test\n- ~15 new tests\n- Second-viewport delta only (dropdowns, edit links reposition)\n\n**Commit 2 (visible, PNG-verified before merge):**\n- Pseudo synthesis after normal children complete\n- `content: ''` → zero-width box positioned per absolute rules\n- Title \"HTML\" underline appears\n- **Render-and-inspect PNG required before merge** (ADR-039 lesson)\n\n**Commit 3 (docs):**\n- ADR-042 → Implemented\n- Post-ADR-042 notes in ADR-033 and ADR-041\n- README + CHANGELOG\n\n## Deferred (enumerated in ADR)\n\n- Multi-level containing block walk-up (v1 uses direct parent — covers 100% of first-viewport)\n- `top`/`left` visual offsets on `position: relative`\n- `position: sticky` (needs scroll state)\n- Percentages in `top`/`bottom`/`left`/`right` (needs `parent_content_height`)\n- Over-constrained cases (left wins per CSS §10.3.7 LTR)\n- `content: 'literal text'` pseudo synthesis (inline path)\n- `content: attr() / counter() / url()` (ADR-041 deferred)\n\n## Reviewer checklist\n\n- [ ] **Parent-only containing block** — real CSS walks up to nearest positioned ancestor; v1 uses direct parent only. Covers 100% of first-viewport. Comfortable?\n- [ ] **Skip-in-dispatch approach** — each dispatcher (block/flex/grid) skips absolute children inline, collects, positions after. ~3 changes vs ~15 for pre-extraction. Agree?\n- [ ] **Pseudo synthesis in Commit 2, not Commit 1** — separates behavior change (no visual) from visible delta (title underline). PNG verification gate on Commit 2. Agree?\n- [ ] **`position: fixed` untouched** — ADR-033's special case stays as-is; ADR-042 doesn't affect fixed. Agree?\n- [ ] **ADR-033 test update is expected** — `test_layout.cpp:1721` asserts \"absolute stored but static\" — explicitly superseded by ADR-042. Not a regression, a deferral closure.\n\n## Test plan\n\nNo code changes. Post-merge: `cmake --build build && ./build/tests/honeybee_tests` — 518 / 1980 unchanged.\n\n## ADR\n\n`docs/decisions/042-absolute-positioning.md` — Status Accepted; implementation in follow-up PR.\n\nRefs #208",
